course: dictionary
lesson: 16042
title: Slang and informal words
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Vibes» is a slang word. Slang is informal language that friends often use in chat, but it is not the best choice in a formal essay or a school report. Read the words around it to find its meaning.
explain: «The café had lovely, cosy vibes.» Lovely and cosy are clues. They tell us the feeling is warm and nice, so vibes means the mood or feeling a place gives you. Try swapping in «atmosphere»: the sentence still makes sense.
explain: «The party had weird vibes, so we left early.» Weird and left early tell us the feeling was uncomfortable, so vibes can be bad as well as good. Vibes can also be the short name for the vibraphone in music, so always check which meaning fits the sentence.
fact: «Vibes» is informal slang, so keep it for chatting with friends.
fact: Vibes means the feelings or mood that a place, person, song or situation gives you.
fact: «It's a vibe» means something feels good or cool.
fact: «Vibing» means relaxing and enjoying the mood.
fact: In formal writing, use atmosphere, mood or impression instead of vibes.
exercise: «The shop had friendly vibes.» What does vibes mean here? | The price of things in the shop | Vibes are a type of shop | Loud music only | *The feeling or mood the shop gives you
exercise: Which word would be best in a formal school essay instead of vibes? | Vibe check | Vibing | Cool | *Atmosphere
exercise: In a music lesson, vibes can mean what? | *The vibraphone, a metal instrument like a xylophone | A spooky ghost | A sad song | A kind of bus
test: «The team had good vibes all week.» Which word is closest in meaning to vibes here? | Fight | Map | Sleep | *Mood
test: «We were vibing in the park all afternoon.» What does vibing mean? | *Relaxing and enjoying the mood | Doing homework | Running very fast | Shouting at friends
exam: «The room gave off strange vibes, so I did not stay.» What do the vibes tell you about the room? | *It felt uneasy or odd | It was very bright and sunny | It smelled of cake | It was full of friends and games
